\begin{example}
\label{example-K0-polynomial-ring}
Let $k$ be a field. Then $K_0(k[x]) = K'_0(k[x]) = \mathbf{Z}$.
This follows from Example \ref{example-K0-PID} as
$R = k[x]$ is a PID.
\end{example}

